{
  "description": "a markdown auth document passes once the auth antecedent holds",
  "covers": [
    "auth-md",
    "oauth-discovery"
  ],
  "target": "https://example.com/",
  "site_type": null,
  "spec_version": "0.0.0-corpus",
  "unmatched": {
    "status": 404,
    "headers": {
      "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
    },
    "body": "<html><body><h1>Not found</h1><p>No such page.</p></body></html>"
  },
  "allow_unmatched": true,
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
        },
        "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Example: a site with agent entry points.\">\n<link rel=\"service-desc\" href=\"/openapi.json\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/markdown\" href=\"/index.md\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\"}</script>\n<script src=\"/js/webmcp.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>Example</h1>\n<p>Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. </p>\n</main>\n<noscript><a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a> <a href=\"/openapi.json\">OpenAPI</a></noscript>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/.well-known/openid-configuration"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"issuer\":\"https://example.com\",\"authorization_endpoint\":\"https://example.com/authorize\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/.well-known/auth.md"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "text/markdown; charset=utf-8"
        },
        "body": "# Auth\n\nRegister at /signup.\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}
